    "raw_content": "# AG General Contractor\n\nMiami, FL\n\nAboutFinancialsPeopleDealsFunding\n\n### About AG General Contractor\n\nCompany overview\n\nAG General Contractor is a privately-held construction company that specializes in creating bespoke luxury homes. AG General Contractor was founded in 1980 by Guillermo Gaona and Pablo Allamand Sr. AG General Contractor headquarters are located in Miami, Florida.\n\nKeywords\n\n### Revenue\n\nRevenue\n\n### EBITDA\n\nEBITDA\n\n### Valuation\n\nValuation\n\nIncome Statement\n\n| Line Item | 2024 | 2023 | 2022 | 2021 | 2020 |\n ---  ---  --- |\n| Revenues | $380 MM | $250 MM | $90 MM | $120 MM | $65 MM |\n| Gross Profit | $190 MM | $125 MM | $45 MM | $60 MM | $32.50 MM |\n| Net Income (Loss) | $43 MM | $25 MM | $9 MM | $12 MM | $6.50 MM |\n\nMembers Only\n### Industry\nResidential Building Construction\n\n### Company Size\n11-50 employees  \n14 associated members (LinkedIn members who've listed AG General Contractor as their current workplace on their profile)\n\n### Founded\n1980\n\n### Funding\nLast Round Date: N/A\nLast Round Type: N/A\nTotal Rounds: N/A\nLast Round Raised: N/A\n\n### Investors\nN/A\n\n### Specialties\ngeneral contractor, luxury single family homes, and construction\n\n## Locations\n1385 Coral Way, 202, MIAMI BEACH, FL 33140, US\n\n### Get Directions\nDirections\n\n## Employees\nPablo Allamand (N/A):  LinkedIn Member (N/A): N/A; LinkedIn Member (N/A): N/A; LinkedIn Member (N/A): N/A; LinkedIn Member (N/A): N/A; LinkedIn Member (N/A): N/A [...] # AG General Contractor\nMiami\u2019s Award-Winning Custom Luxury Homes Design & Build \ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f | 40+ Years Expertise | \ud83c\udde8\ud83c\uddf1\ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\nResidential Building Construction \u2022 MIAMI BEACH, FL \u2022 309 followers \u2022 11-50 employees\n\n## Overview\nAt AG General Contractor, we specialize in creating bespoke luxury homes that blend innovative design with superior craftsmanship. With over four decades of experience, our commitment to quality, collaboration, innovation and transparency has positioned us as leaders in Miami's high-end residential construction market. Proudly serving both Chilean and American clients, we deliver unparalleled service and exceptional results, making dream homes a reality.\n\n### Website\n\n### Crunchbase\nN/A\n### LinkedIn\nN/A\n\n### Industry\nResidential Building Construction [...] ## Similar Companies\nAGD Developers (Real Estate):  (Miami, 1385 Coral Way); Concrete Structures | General Contractor Division (Construction):  (Sunrise, Florida); Jaco General Contractor, Inc. (Construction):  (Wichita, Kansas); MIK Architecture (Architecture and Planning):  (Miami, FL); Accelerated Construction Services (ACS) | General Contractor (Construction):  (ORLANDO, FLORIDA); DBS Corporation - General Contractor (Construction):  (Chattanooga, Tennessee); Kalam AG (Construction):  (Miami, Florida); Coastal Construction Company (Construction):  (Miami, Florida); General Contractor Services USA (Construction):  (Coral Gables, florida); AG Contractors FL (Construction):  (Miami, Florida)\n[](\n\nGet a Free Quote\n\n# AG General Construction LLC\n\nOur History\n\nBook Now\n\n## Our History\n\nAG General Construction LLC was founded over 14 years ago by Aaron Garcia, whose passion for home remodeling was shaped by years of hands-on experience working for other reputable contractors in the field. With a deep understanding of the craft and a vision to offer something more personal, Aaron built the company from the ground up\u2014starting with small handyman jobs and home repairs. [...] In the early days, the business operated solely on word of mouth and trusted referrals, serving local families with care, reliability, and skill. What began as a one-man operation has since evolved into a family-owned and fully insured company with a growing team, professional-grade tools, and a proud reputation across the DMV area.\n\nThrough the years, we\u2019ve earned the trust of homeowners and industry professionals alike\u2014taking on larger remodeling projects and building strong partnerships with other general contractors. We continue to grow, but one thing remains constant: our commitment to quality craftsmanship, attention to detail, and customized work that reflects each client\u2019s unique vision. [...] At AG General Construction LLC, our story is still being written\u2014one successful project at a time.\n\nView Our Services\n\n## AG General Construction LLC\n\nOur Professional Services\n\n#### kitchen Remodeling\n\nLearn More\n\n#### Bathroom Remodeling\n\nLearn More\n\n#### Painting Services\n\nLearn More\n\n#### Flooring\n\nLearn More\n\nView All Services\n\n## Why Choose Us?\n\nAt AG General Construction LLC, we go beyond building and remodeling \u2014 we build trust. With over 14 years of hands-on experience, our licensed and insured team delivers high-quality, eco-conscious solutions tailored to each homeowner\u2019s unique needs.\n\nFrom the first consultation to the final walkthrough, we prioritize clear communication, custom craftsmanship, and client satisfaction at every step.\n\n\uf807\n# Carlos Gonzalez\nAG Contractors & Design\nMiami, Florida, United States, US  \n500 connections, 749 followers\n\n## About\nI am CEO, Building Contractor and Co\u2011Founder of AG Contractors and Design Corp, a\u2026\n\n## Experience\nN/A\n\n## Education\nN/A\n\n## Publications\nN/A\n\n## Honors & Awards\nN/A\n\n## Certifications\nN/A\n\n## Volunteering\nN/A\n\n## Languages\nN/A\n\n## Organizations\nN/A\n\n## Activity\n- Visita t\u00e9cnica a la ampliaci\u00f3n de la L\u00ednea 11 del Metro de Madrid, desde Plaza El\u00edptica hasta Conde de Casal, junto al grupo de J\u00f3venes de\u2026  \nLiked by Carlos Gonzalez  \nView Post  \nActivity Image\n\n- Lessons from 2025 | Leading as a Woman in Business 2025 reinforced a fundamental truth: not everyone wants to see you grow. Understanding this isn\u2019t\u2026  \nLiked by Carlos Gonzalez  \nView Post  \nActivity Image [...] - Feliz Navidad y un Pr\u00f3spero A\u00f1o Nuevo! Ya es diciembre, el \u00faltimo mes del a\u00f1o 2025, y es momento de reflexionar sobre lo que ha pasado y mirar hacia\u2026  \nShared by Carlos Gonzalez  \nView Post  \nActivity Image\n\n- Ever noticed how a project can have all the right people, resources and intentions and still feel chaotic? I came across this illustration and it\u2026  \nLiked by Carlos Gonzalez  \nView Post  \nActivity Image\n\n- Porque no todo es t\u00edtulo  \nLiked by Carlos Gonzalez  \nView Post  \nActivity Image\n\n- \"Accounting Opportunity Alert! AG Contractors & Design is seeking an Account Manager to join our team! We're looking for a detail-oriented and\u2026  \nPosted by Carlos Gonzalez  \nView Post  \nActivity Image\nPresident\n\nArmstrong Steel Erectors, Inc.\n\nNewark, Ohio\n\nPosition on the AGC Board: At-Large Member\n\nWAYNE HAMMON\n\nChief Executive Officer\n\nIdaho AGC\n\nBoise, Idaho\n\nPosition on AGC Board: Chair-Elect, Chapter Executive Leadership Council\n\nBRYAN KELLEY\n\nSenior Vice President and Chief Legal Officer\n\nBalfour Beatty Construction, LLC\n\nSeattle, Washington\n\nPosition on AGC Board: Chair, Building Division\n\nPaul Mashburn\n\nChief Executive\n\nMashburn Construction\n\nColumbia, South Carolina\n\nPosition on AGC Board: At-Large Member\n\nPAUL MOORE\n\nOwner\n\nMoore Construction Services, LLC\n\nBirmingham, Alabama\n\nPosition on AGC Board: At-Large Member\n\nTONI LYNN PASCAL\n\nPresident\n\nPascal Construction Co.\n\nDenver, Colorado\n\nPosition on AGC Board: Vice Chair, Utility Infrastructure Division\n\nTODD PETERSON [...] Home\n\n## Main navigation\n\n## User account menu\n\n## About\n\n## Header Menu\n\n# Leadership\n\nAGC of America is governed by a Management Committee, Board of Directors and a Board of Governors.\n\n## Board of Directors\n\nThe Board of Directors is the governing body of the Association. The Board has full authority to define policy governing its own conduct and the affairs of the Association. The Board is composed of the AGC Officers, the Occupational Division Chairs and Vice Chairs, the Specialty Contractors Council Chair, the Service & Supply Council Chair, the President of the Executive Leadership Council (ELC), and nine (9) members selected by the President.\n\n## The 2026 AGC Officers are:\n\nRICK ANDRITSCH\n\nRICK ANDRITSCH\n\nRICK ANDRITSCH [...] TODD PETERSON\n\nPrincipal \n\nPeterson Contractors, Inc.\n\nReinbeck, Iowa\n\nPosition on AGC Board: Vice Chair, Highway & Transportation Division\n\nTODD ROBERTS\n\nPresident\n\nERS Inc.\n\nJackson, Mississippi\n\nPosition on AGC Board: 2025 President\n\nJUSTIN ROSS\n\nNational Accounts Manager \n\nMilwaukee Tool\n\nBrookfield, Wisconsin\n\nPosition on AGC Board: Chair, Service & Supply Committee\n\nMILTON SMITH\n\nExecutive Vice President, National Surety Director\n\nMcGriff Specialty, an MMA Company\n\nBirmingham, Alabama\n\nPosition on AGC Board:  At-Large Member\n\nALGERNON STANLEY\n\nVice President for Project Management\n\nStanley Construction Company\n\nHuntsville, Alabama\n\nPosition on AGC Board: Chair, Highway & Transportation Division\n\nDOUG TABELING\n\nGeneral Counsel\n\nCarroll Daniel Construction Company\nMarketing Manager\n\n### Constanza Gatica\n\nConstanza brings a refreshing perspective to our company. Her exceptional creativity and proactive initiative enable her to excel at generating impactful ideas and transforming concepts into reality.\n\n### Tatiana Paredes\n\nSenior Project Manager\n\n### Tatiana Paredes\n\nTatiana brings expertise in architecture and construction management to AG General Contractor in Sarasota, Florida. She played a key role in one of our first affordable housing projects and, with her proactive leadership and organizational skills, ensures every phase runs smoothly, on time, and to the highest standards.\n\n### Rodrigo Navarrete\n\nChief Foreman\n\n### Rodrigo Navarrete [...] ### Guillermo Gaona\n\nFounder & Board Member\n\n### Guillermo Gaona\n\nFounder and architect with over four decades of experience, he merges an entrepreneurial vision with a passion for innovation and continuous learning. His expertise spans both architecture and real estate, allowing him to address the unique needs of residential developers.\n\nGerardo Guzman\n\n### Gerardo Guzman\n\nExecutive Director\n\n### Gerardo Guzman\n\nGerardo brings a wealth of expertise in many areas to our organization, playing a pivotal role in strategic decision-making processes. Gerardo's leadership is integral to driving our organization towards success and growth.\n\n### Pablo Allamand Jr.\n\nChief Operating Officer\n\n### Pablo Allamand Jr. [...] Skip to footer\n\n### About us\n\n# Who we Are\n\nAG General Contractor was founded in the 1980s by Pablo Allamand and Guillermo Gaona with a clear mission\u2014to create meaningful change in both the industry and the communities we serve. From the beginning, our commitment to innovation and client satisfaction set us apart, leading to one of our most notable projects: Santiago Downtown. This ambitious development of seven buildings in the heart of Santiago\u2019s business district became a testament to our expertise and vision.\nIn the early days, the business operated solely on word of mouth and trusted referrals, serving local families with care, reliability, and skill. What began as a one-man operation has since evolved into a family-owned and fully insured company with a growing team, professional-grade tools, and a proud reputation across the DMV area.\n\nThrough the years, we\u2019ve earned the trust of homeowners and industry professionals alike\u2014taking on larger remodeling projects and building strong partnerships with other general contractors. We continue to grow, but one thing remains constant: our commitment to quality craftsmanship, attention to detail, and customized work that reflects each client\u2019s unique vision. [...] At AG General Construction LLC, our story is still being written\u2014one successful project at a time.\n\nView Our Services\n\n## AG General Construction LLC\n\nOur Professional Services\n\n#### kitchen Remodeling\n\nLearn More\n\n#### Bathroom Remodeling\n\nLearn More\n\n#### Painting Services\n\nLearn More\n\n#### Flooring\n\nLearn More\n\nView All Services\n\n## Why Choose Us?\n\nAt AG General Construction LLC, we go beyond building and remodeling \u2014 we build trust. With over 14 years of hands-on experience, our licensed and insured team delivers high-quality, eco-conscious solutions tailored to each homeowner\u2019s unique needs.\n\nFrom the first consultation to the final walkthrough, we prioritize clear communication, custom craftsmanship, and client satisfaction at every step.\n\n\uf807 [...] [](\n\nGet a Free Quote\n\n# AG General Construction LLC\n\nOur History\n\nBook Now\n\n## Our History\n\nAG General Construction LLC was founded over 14 years ago by Aaron Garcia, whose passion for home remodeling was shaped by years of hands-on experience working for other reputable contractors in the field. With a deep understanding of the craft and a vision to offer something more personal, Aaron built the company from the ground up\u2014starting with small handyman jobs and home repairs.\nHome\n\n## Main navigation\n\n## User account menu\n\n## About\n\n## Header Menu\n\n# About Us\n\nVision Statement  \nThe Associated General Contractors will be the organization of choice for those associated with the construction industry.\n\nMission Statement  \nThe Associated General Contractors of America, the voice of the construction industry, is an organization of qualified construction contractors and industry related companies dedicated to skill, integrity and responsibility.  Operating in partnership with its Chapters, the Association provides a full range of services satisfying the needs and concerns of its members, thereby improving the quality of construction and protecting the public interest.\n\nAnnual Reports  \nYou can find our most recent reports here.\n\n## <none>",
