    "raw_content": "AMP\nAMP\n\n# Smell of Success: AcScents Soap Co. Growing Organically\n\nPictured above: Jess, left, and Donaya Herron. Photos by Sarah DeClerk\n\nNestled in the artsy SoMa district of Little Rock is AcScents Soap Co., a one-of-a-kind boutique specializing in all-natural beauty products for men. Owner Jess Herron said she never set out to work in skincare, let alone start her own beauty company, but after founding AcScents in 2012, she has watched the company grow from a true cottage industry into a thriving business with more to come.\n\n\u201cThis right here is a little hub,\u201d Herron said. \u201cIt\u2019s a little hidden gem. I would love for more people to know about it, but sometimes I like that we\u2019re so quaint and small because when people come in, we\u2019ve had some really serious conversations.\u201d [...] \u201cI just love helping people,\u201d she said. \u201cI real ly, really, really believe if you have something that is good and something that has helped anybody, you can help multiple people. It wasn\u2019t just meant for you to help that one person, and we started selling here in Arkansas.\u201d\n\nMore specifically, her mother started selling the products in Arkansas, a place Herron had never been.\n\n\u201cI was selling in Florida, where we lived at the time, and she said, \u2018Jess, I got so many compliments from work. Have you thought about selling and maybe putting up some little stuff?\u2019\u201d Herron said. \u201cI\u2019m an introvert. I\u2019m such an introvert, so I\u2019m like, \u2018Mom, I don\u2019t know about that. You\u2019re down there if you want to do it.\u2019 She was like, \u2018Yeah, baby girl. Send me your stuff.\u2019\u201d [...] AcScents was not always focused on men exclusively, however. When the shop opened at its first location on University Avenue in 2019, it sold products for the whole family. After moving to SoMa in 2021, however, Jess Herron realized the women were not coming in like they used to.\n\n\u201cWe changed packaging six times inside of one year because the women were like, \u2018Can I have this?\u2019 so I did it. \u2018Well, we want it to look like this,\u2019 so I did it,\u201d she said. \u201cIt felt great; they just wanted it to look different. Meanwhile, the guys weren\u2019t saying anything. They just loved it. They were like, \u2018Hey, Jess, I had this rash. It\u2019s gone. Give me more of that cream,\u2019 and the ladies, it was just I couldn\u2019t please them. Nothing I did was enough.\u201d\nAmber Nights\nAmber Nights\n\n#### Amber Nights\n\nBarrel Bourbon Toffee Collection\nBarrel Bourbon Toffee Collection\n\n#### Barrel Bourbon Toffee Collection [...] ## Country/Region\n\n## Country/Region\n\nHave an account? Log in to check out faster.\n\nEnjoy 50% OFF The Mississippi Dirt Collection!\n\n# Luxury Skincare For Men\n\nExperience Our Latest Fragrances!\n\nSkincare Made Simple\n\nExperience the benefits of turmeric, honey, shea butter, and rose water in this bestselling collection of facial care products, including a brightening cleansing bar, rose water toner, and more!\n\nLet Us Cater To You\n\n1-on-1 Shopping Experience\n\nExperience personalized skincare like never before with our exclusive 1-on-1 shopping & skin care consultations\n\nYour Skin IS Our Business!\n\nAccessories\nAccessories\n\n#### Accessories\n\nAcScents Soap Co. Gift Card\n\n#### AcScents Soap Co. Gift Card\n\nAmber Nights\nAmber Nights\n\n#### Amber Nights\nSoMa\nSoMa\n\n# SoMa 501 Biz Spotlight: AcScents Soap Co. - Crafting Natural Beauty, One Bar at a Time\n\nMeet AcScents Soap Co., where the artistry of organic bath and body care meets the science of men's skincare. Founded and nurtured by Jess Herron, this boutique enterprise has carved its niche by meticulously crafting exquisite, natural products.\n\nAt the core of AcScents Soap Co. is the belief that skincare is not just a routine but a celebration of life and community. Situated amidst the crossroads of bustling highways, SoMa serves as a central gathering point for people from all walks of life. For Jess and her team, this thriving community is more than just a backdrop; it's the vibrant tapestry upon which their business thrives. [...] So, what led AcScents Soap Co. to choose SoMa as its home? In Jess's own words, \"I envisioned a boutique straight out of a Hallmark movie, and SoMa provided the perfect setting for that dream.\" With its quaint charm and a sense of unity among local businesses, SoMa offered the ideal canvas for this vision. AcScents Soap Co. found its place among like-minded entrepreneurs who share a passion for crafting authentic, high-quality products.\n\nJess and her team are determined to make SoMa their permanent home for years to come. Their future plans include expanding their online presence and community engagement. They aim not only to provide great customer experiences but also to become a household name within the city and state. [...] ## Subscribe to our Mailing List\nAmber Nights\nAmber Nights\n\n#### Amber Nights\n\nBarrel Bourbon Toffee Collection\nBarrel Bourbon Toffee Collection\n\n#### Barrel Bourbon Toffee Collection [...] ## Country/Region\n\n## Country/Region\n\nHave an account? Log in to check out faster.\n\nEnjoy 50% OFF The Mississippi Dirt Collection!\n\n# Luxury Skincare For Men\n\nExperience Our Latest Fragrances!\n\nSkincare Made Simple\n\nExperience the benefits of turmeric, honey, shea butter, and rose water in this bestselling collection of facial care products, including a brightening cleansing bar, rose water toner, and more!\n\nLet Us Cater To You\n\n1-on-1 Shopping Experience\n\nExperience personalized skincare like never before with our exclusive 1-on-1 shopping & skin care consultations\n\nYour Skin IS Our Business!\n\nAccessories\nAccessories\n\n#### Accessories\n\nAcScents Soap Co. Gift Card\n\n#### AcScents Soap Co. Gift Card\n\nAmber Nights\nAmber Nights\n\n#### Amber Nights\nAMP\nAMP\n\n# Smell of Succe