ccessories\n\nAcScents Soap Co. Gift Card\n\n#### AcScents Soap Co. Gift Card\n\nAmber Nights\nAmber Nights\n\n#### Amber Nights\n\nBarrel Bourbon Toffee Collection\nBarrel Bourbon Toffee Collection [...] #### Barrel Bourbon Toffee Collection\nAMP\nAMP\n\n# Smell of Success: AcScents Soap Co. Growing Organically\n\nPictured above: Jess, left, and Donaya Herron. Photos by Sarah DeClerk\n\nNestled in the artsy SoMa district of Little Rock is AcScents Soap Co., a one-of-a-kind boutique specializing in all-natural beauty products for men. Owner Jess Herron said she never set out to work in skincare, let alone start her own beauty company, but after founding AcScents in 2012, she has watched the company grow from a true cottage industry into a thriving business with more to come.\n\n\u201cThis right here is a little hub,\u201d Herron said. \u201cIt\u2019s a little hidden gem. I would love for more people to know about it, but sometimes I like that we\u2019re so quaint and small because when people come in, we\u2019ve had some really serious conversations.\u201d [...] \u201cI hit the ground rolling with AcScents Soap,\u201d she said. \u201cI did stop along the way. I had some really great jobs I was good at, to be honest. I was selling cars. It was some money. I kind of put AcScents off to the side for a while, and the more I put it to the side, the worse things were getting on jobs, if that makes sense, and to me, it just told me that this was my purpose. This was what I was supposed to do, and it\u2019s so much more than soap.\u201d\n\nThe products are all made in-house at the on-site soap lab using organic and, when possible, local ingredients, including Bluewing, an ale brewed by Flyway Brewing in North Little Rock, used in the beer soap, and spirits from SoMa neighbor Rock Town Distillery, which are used in AcScents\u2019 aftershaves. [...] \u201cWe like to show our guys that you can pamper yourself,\u201d Donaya said. \u201cYou can take care of yourself, still be a man, still be masculine, but when you have your best foot forward every day, you have a whole different perspective. You\u2019re able to walk out the door knowing that I\u2019m smelling good, I\u2019m feeling good. It\u2019s a whole different level of confidence whether you\u2019re walking into the office, the boardroom or you\u2019re walking onto a construction site.\u201d\n\nThe shop offers a happy hour from 2 to 4 p.m., during which men can sip and shop and receive discounts on alcohol-inspired collections such as Midnight Whiskey. A customer loyalty program allows customers to earn additional discounts through points and rewards.",
